 in Tarot Card readings and alchemy. He uses spells to either get information he wants, to punish someone, or as surveillance. Matcha owns a tavern called the Lavender Tounge Tavern which is a cafe/bar deep in a mystical Forest. There he serves Coffee, tea, Alcohol, potions, and by far the most popular are his fortunes. \nHis magic comes from his familiar which is a mystical bat with the body of a starry night sky that when it's tired stays in the crystal on Matcha's bowtie to replenish its magic. Matcha has named this bat Lavy, Lavy can turn into  a bat style Halberd if a weapon is needed, or a tall emaciated looking beast.\n\nReferences:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1I_x-9--AamQCN8e8Fg33r9IXIktZ430y?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@4rou99/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/87d477af/uploads/origins/07448b76-f40a-4110-a383-efb1252ae0e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1d09beb676f98872cd444e8a04729a81", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/87d477af/uploads/origins/07448b76-f40a-4110-a383-efb1252ae0e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1d09beb676f98872cd444e8a04729a81, https://si.imgix.net/87d477af/uploads/origins/07448b76-f40a-4110-a383-efb1252ae0e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbd15acee99753cc4c2385ffa1c7409f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/87d477af/uploads/origins/07448b76-f40a-4110-a383-efb1252ae0e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5252b841b69720b1770e029cd4bb0bc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello i plan on covering a song and would like you to make the art! if possible can you separate the character from the background! if you can, make the different versions if not that is fine!\ncharacter reference https://imgur.com/a/Zx4LiZW\npose reference https://imgur.com/a/TiegHwS", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@4rou99/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/595f1e4b/uploads/origins/c3712f8c-0965-4792-998b-d83806e2f11e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dffa8d3ae604ee7b91c0340ade781ed9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/595f1e4b/uploads/origins/c3712f8c-0965-4792-998b-d83806e2f11e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dffa8d3ae604ee7b91c0340ade781ed9, https://si.imgix.net/595f1e4b/uploads/origins/c3712f8c-0965-4792-998b-d83806e2f11e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=71f8629793a1f71cb97abf6accc4448a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/595f1e4b/uploads/origins/c3712f8c-0965-4792-998b-d83806e2f11e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e21cad5c3835a9c972ca18949e254cbb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして、シロウです。\nあなたの画風は、魅力的な目と滑らかな髪の質感を持つキャラクターを描き、あなたの作品の持つ明るい雰囲気に魅了されています。今回、私のオリジナルキャラクターを描いて頂きたいと思います。ドキドキすると人の言葉に耳を貸さなくなるような若い男性です。薬学や毒物学の知識が豊富で、パーティーの菓子器に毒を入れて母親や義父など数十人を殺害している。時々、まだ子供のような行動をとるが、他人にその弱さを見せることはない。\nこのキャラクターを理解した上で、自由に描いてください!よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/fungi_feast/status/1552923355547717634?s=21&t=CcwS6aSezYAoqjTPH5eJkA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@4rou99/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5b26122b/uploads/origins/7b452279-419c-4a1f-b3f8-51f2c719a250?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c6c2d47180a088512291d44e24f1033", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5b26122b/uploads/origins/7b452279-419c-4a1f-b3f8-51f2c719a250?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c6c2d47180a088512291d44e24f1033, https://si.imgix.net/5b26122b/uploads/origins/7b452279-419c-4a1f-b3f8-51f2c719a250?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27e2e8b8dae4c07d8c2fe2839456a22f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5b26122b/uploads/origins/7b452279-419c-4a1f-b3f8-51f2c719a250?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d97cb04d822a338e5db17441020976ef 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして，私は海外のVtuberで活動します，語風薯薯様\nもし私を描いて頂ければ幸いです。\n\n■人物\n・名前:語風薯薯\n・ちゅうにびょう/明るい性格で/無鉄砲（むてっぽう）170cm\n・URLを参考にしてください\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1YHLia9bEp7AHq8LkIOJZTSSHZbZw2AFn/view?usp=sharing\n\n■要素が含まれています\n・腹筋を見せたい\n・髪型やポーズ等、にお任せさせて頂ければと思います\n・顔差分があったらすごく助かります！\n・できればセクシーなポーズでお願いします。 \n・自由に描いてください\n\n■背景\n・自由に創造してください\n\n■サイズ\n・（橫 /3,840*2,160↑）300dpi\n\n■使用用途\nSNSアイコン、SNSでの宣伝、PCの壁紙、動画など、配信サムネイル\n\nサムネに使いやすいように、髪の毛や手などが見切れていないように描いてほしいです。背景とキャラクターを分離を頂ければ幸いです。よろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@4rou99/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1458e612/uploads/origins/8e99e3fb-df10-469c-9da3-4740bc8a4e0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2aa06291f569f1c905c1f00fff4ed9e2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1458e612/uploads/origins/8e99e3fb-df10-469c-9da3-4740bc8a4e0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2aa06291f569f1c905c1f00fff4ed9e2, https://si.imgix.net/1458e612/uploads/origins/8e99e3fb-df10-469c-9da3-4740bc8a4e0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b3e092cb22fd31006c91e5c7ffb33ace 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1458e612/uploads/origins/8e99e3fb-df10-469c-9da3-4740bc8a4e0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3a4edce48989c5d006af99f6e129c10f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "